00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:26.660
Everything will be a mixture of fun list videos,
easter egg videos and reviews of the Christmas

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:30.990
Special, the Sherlock Mini Episode and Q and
As where I answer all your best questions

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:31.990
in a video.

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:38.149
Be sure to subscribe to get everything and
if you want me to answer your questions in

00:00:38.149 --> 00:00:40.680
